# Security Reports Directory

This directory contains automated vulnerability scan reports.

## Reports

- `vulnerability-scan-*.json` - npm audit results with filtered vulnerabilities

## Usage

Run security check:
```bash
npm run security:check
```

Run in CI/CD with strict mode:
```bash
npm run security:check:ci
```

## Configuration

Set environment variables to configure:
- `VULN_MIN_SEVERITY` - Minimum severity to report (low, moderate, high, critical)
- `VULN_FAIL_BUILD` - Fail build on vulnerabilities (true/false)
- `VULN_ALLOWED` - Comma-separated list of allowed advisory IDs

## Report Retention

Reports are not committed to git. Keep last 10 reports locally for reference.
